WEBVTT

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:04.990
Pyonsuke!!

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:15.540
Sonya-chan!

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:18.900
You'll pay for killing Pyonsuke 02!

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:25.840
What the hell do you think you're doing?

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:28.880
You killed Pyonsuke 02!

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:30.610
In my dream!

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:31.800
Dream?

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:34.810
Like I care about your dreams!

00:02:49.630 --> 00:02:51.500
One morning.

00:02:52.890 --> 00:02:54.910
Morning!

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:58.550
What's with that? It looks cool!

00:02:58.550 --> 00:03:00.620
It's nothing.

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:04.500
I'm going to the infirmary!

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:05.840
Here we go again.

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:12.210
Well? Cool, right?

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:13.550
Don't waste those!

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:15.680
What if they're out and someone needs one?

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:17.430
Well it's too late now.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:20.250
I've already used it.

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:24.840
Now it isn't being wasted.

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:26.210
So mean!

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:28.740
You didn't have to go and hurt me!

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:30.700
Wait a second...

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:34.890
If you get treated before you get hurt...

00:03:34.890 --> 00:03:35.840
Huh?

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:37.990
This is an amazing discovery!

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:40.730
Why hasn't anyone thought of it before?

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:41.710
Uh...

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:46.430
If I plaster up places that I might get hurt...

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:49.040
I feel invincible now!

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:53.970
Even if I get hit like this...

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.770
Obviously.

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:00.510
I'm totally fine!

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:01.910
You're shaking.

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:05.000
Wouldn't a poultice be more effective in this case?

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:08.570
Wow, you actually offered a useful suggestion!

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:10.670
There you go.

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:11.990
Thank you!

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:13.820
Now you'll be fine even if I hit you.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:15.660
What's with that pole?!

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:18.830
You don't need to test it out!

00:04:19.450 --> 00:04:22.280
I was going to help you out, too...

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:25.200
Shouldn't you be the one wearing this, anyway?

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:28.040
You seem like you'd get hurt a lot in your work.

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:33.110
I've got a super-strong bulletproof undervest under my uniform, so I'm okay.

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:34.540
What, really?

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:37.470
That's so cool! Can I hit you to see?

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:39.990
I won't feel a thing.

00:04:43.270 --> 00:04:45.870
You said I could hit you!

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:48.110
Isn't it obvious I meant on my body?!

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:54.690
If you were going to do that, you should have hit here to start with.

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:55.950
Here.

00:04:55.950 --> 00:05:01.620
So mean! You already got me back, but you hit me again!

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:03.960
Uh... sorry.

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:13.590
So you really do have a protective vest, huh...

00:05:13.590 --> 00:05:14.940
Yup.

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:17.760
I'll do it properly this time, so can I try again?

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:20.420
You're going to regret it if you miss again.

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:26.150
Eh?

00:05:26.150 --> 00:05:28.010
Are you okay?

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:29.290
I'm fine...

00:05:29.290 --> 00:05:32.320
That was just a little sudden, so it surprised me a bit.

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:34.240
I said I was going!

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:36.160
Can I try again?

00:05:37.220 --> 00:05:40.140
Don't tell me you forgot to wear it...

00:05:40.140 --> 00:05:41.540
I-I'm totally wearing it!

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:44.320
Let me go again then.

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:46.330
Just once more.

00:05:47.170 --> 00:05:49.060
Alright, go!

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:51.250
Why are you straining like that?

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:52.550
Alright...

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:54.930
Wait, no kicking!

00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:56.210
Why not?

00:05:56.210 --> 00:06:00.560
It isn't made to withstand that sort of impact.

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:02.460
Even though it's bulletproof?

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:06.260
That's because... bullets are small.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:09.330
I'm sure there's some physics design behind it.

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:12.410
Like Pascal's law or Taylor's theorem,

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:15.940
or Flemming's left-hand rule, you know...

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:17.470
Well, whatever.

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:20.950
I can tell you weren't wearing it to begin with.

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:25.950
Poultices won't help against bone fractures!

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:29.530
It's not like I was really going to kick you!

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:31.110
I don't trust you.

00:06:31.110 --> 00:06:32.590
Fracture...

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:37.260
Wait, if I wear a cast from the start, I'll be totally safe!

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:42.070
How can I avoid injuries?

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:46.930
In your case, if you were to use your brain just a little, you'd get hurt a lot less.

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:50.400
Your injury rate is based on your IQ?

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:52.000
You don't get it, huh...

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:53.430
You really are hopeless.

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:58.500
I get it! You're dumb, which is why you got hurt.

00:06:59.570 --> 00:07:01.670
You did it again!

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:03.610
Because you're stupid in the head!

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:08.510
No, the world would be a more peaceful place if you were more gentle!

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:10.500
Why bring the world into this?

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:13.490
Dammit! Dammit!

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:18.760
I'm getting away from you before I get hurt any more!

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:23.680
The next day.

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:27.140
You stink of poultice!

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:32.740
This is my total defense!

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:34.210
Are you still on about that?

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:37.820
It doesn't make a difference if I just have them on!

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:42.460
A few hours later.

00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:47.060
So itchy...

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:48.040
Itchy...

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:51.920
You've had it on so long it's irritating your skin?

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:54.000
Itchy...

00:08:02.130 --> 00:08:04.880
One day, during break.

00:08:09.390 --> 00:08:13.550
I've been so busy lately I haven't had any time to sleep...

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:16.190
I'll take a short nap before class.

00:08:18.070 --> 00:08:20.240
Sonya-chan is crying?!

00:08:20.240 --> 00:08:21.550
Did something happen?

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:25.530
As her friend, I have to cheer her up!

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:29.520
Hi Sonya-chan! Smile!

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:31.000
Shut up.

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:37.990
Though the river's current never fails, the water passing, moment by moment, is never the same.

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:41.390
Where the current pools, bubbles form  on the surface, bursting and disappearing as...

00:08:41.390 --> 00:08:43.140
So sleepy...

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:45.530
I need to jab myself with my pen...

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:47.590
Where is it?

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:50.850
Wait, I think I had one in my pocket...

00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:53.730
Wha—

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:56.170
What are you doing?!

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:58.450
You're acting weird!

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:00.320
Are you angry or something?

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:02.240
No... never mind.

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:17.130
She's really giving off a killer vibe today...

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:21.090
Does she have assassin work after school?

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:30.310
Class is finally done!

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:32.470
Time to go home...

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:37.230
Wait!

00:09:37.230 --> 00:09:39.430
You can't go back today!

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:41.230
You again.

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:42.570
Move.

00:09:42.650 --> 00:09:44.190
No, I won't!

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:52.580
I'm sorry! Give! Give!

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:55.580
I said give!

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:58.460
But I won't give up!

00:09:58.460 --> 00:10:00.500
Please, just go away.

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:04.320
You leave me no choice but to use force!

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:10.290
Why was that so easy?

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:13.850
Thanks. My eyes are open now.

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:18.990
She finally realized that being an assassin is no good!

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:20.800
Sonya-chan!

00:10:25.670 --> 00:10:27.780
Just a little.

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:40.250
Man, I'm sleepy.

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:46.330
I should get a coffee or something.

00:10:56.350 --> 00:10:58.160
Wait!

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:00.430
I'm taking it since she forgot!

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:03.250
Ew. Black coffee?

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:05.520
I can't drink this...

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:07.330
I'll buy something else.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.160
Wait, I don't have time for this!

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:22.130
I'm completely out of energy because I had to run...

00:11:22.130 --> 00:11:25.030
No good...

00:11:26.840 --> 00:11:28.460
Found you!

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:29.960
She's sleeping?

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:32.720
You'll catch a cold if you sleep here.

00:11:35.680 --> 00:11:38.430
She has automated defenses...

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:41.690
I need to wake her up without touching her...

00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:43.800
Hey!

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:48.510
Hey!

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:53.700
Wake up!!

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:55.410
Shut up!

00:11:55.410 --> 00:11:56.570
Just shut it!

00:11:56.570 --> 00:11:57.910
I'm sorry...

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:03.880
I can't just leave her here...

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:07.680
A weird insect!

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:09.760
Ow ow ow ow!

00:12:13.150 --> 00:12:15.130
That was careless of me.

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:17.160
Is she just pretending to sleep?

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:18.600
Woof woof!

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:23.600
Is she dreaming of dogs now?

00:12:23.600 --> 00:12:26.180
Woof woof woof!

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:27.400
Stay away!

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:28.570
Watch it!

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:33.320
Being completely out like this is almost asking me to draw on her face.

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:35.160
In which case...

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:39.400
I'll start with drawing eyes on her...

00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:43.450
What were you trying to do?!

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:46.410
So mean!!

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:48.800
I was looking out for you!

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:49.800
Lies!

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:50.730
It's true!

00:12:50.730 --> 00:12:53.130
You wouldn't get up! I was just—

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:56.690
Like I'd believe such a stupid face!

00:12:56.690 --> 00:13:01.410
But you did this to me!!

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:10.340
February the fourthee... fourtine... fourteen?

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:08.620
I love you...

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:11.410
Oh... thanks.

00:13:10.340 --> 00:13:12.050
Valentine's day!

00:13:11.980 --> 00:13:13.100
I love you...

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:14.950
Tanaka, wait!

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:19.240
Happy Valentine's!

00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:22.080
Here, Sonya-chan!

00:13:22.590 --> 00:13:24.040
What's this?

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:25.240
A chocolate?

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:29.320
On Valentine's Day, girls pour their love into chocolate

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:31.540
and give it to the person they like.

00:13:33.400 --> 00:13:37.490
And you have to pay them back 3 times as much on White Day!

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:40.600
I'll be waiting for yours! I'm totally looking forward it!

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:41.680
I don't need it!

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:43.780
No givebacks!

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:45.730
Once you've accepted, you're not allowed to!

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:48.300
Then I'll give you yours now.

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:50.530
Really? You will?

00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:51.730
Here!

00:14:11.940 --> 00:14:16.800
Ahh, the sunlight is so toasty.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:22.150
You dropped something!

00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:25.100
I guess she isn't paying attention.

00:14:25.270 --> 00:14:28.100
But what is this?

00:14:29.060 --> 00:14:30.820
This is...

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:33.390
...a picture of a guy!

00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:36.980
What's up?

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:39.770
N-Nothing!

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:46.020
Huh?

00:14:46.020 --> 00:14:47.120
What's wrong?

00:14:47.880 --> 00:14:49.790
I dropped something.

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:53.460
Did you...

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:57.050
N-No! I don't have any pictures!

00:14:57.050 --> 00:14:59.760
I don't think you have a bad taste in men!

00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:01.300
Just hand it over.

00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:03.600
If you don't hand it over now...

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:05.520
...you know what'll happen.

00:15:05.760 --> 00:15:07.540
Okay.

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:10.560
Is this really that important to you?

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:11.620
Yes.

00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:13.610
So give it back already.

00:15:19.490 --> 00:15:24.540
Yay! It's an important picture!

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:26.030
You're making me blush!

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:27.290
You little...!

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:30.210
Why the hell are you carrying a picture of yourself around?!

00:15:32.510 --> 00:15:34.680
I bought too much.

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:39.730
What pointless resistance.

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:43.190
Hey, hey.

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:44.700
Who is that?

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:46.310
None of your business.

00:15:46.310 --> 00:15:48.840
C'mon! Tell me!

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:51.150
A target.

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:53.050
That's such a grown-up way to say it!

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:54.290
You'll catch his heart?

00:15:54.290 --> 00:15:59.080
No. You've already forgotten what my line of work is?

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:01.130
Hey...

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:03.090
That's right!

00:16:03.090 --> 00:16:04.970
You seriously forgot?

00:16:04.970 --> 00:16:08.780
No! Don't kill him just because you don't like his face!

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:11.080
That's not the reason why! Let go!

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:13.590
Listen up, this is my job.

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:17.860
Nobody criticizes the hero when he kills a bad guy, right?

00:16:17.860 --> 00:16:20.100
Think of it that way.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:25.680
What on Earth are you talking about heroes for?

00:16:25.680 --> 00:16:26.790
Are you okay?

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:28.080
Dammit...

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:31.350
Even though I tried to explain it in a way she'd understand...

00:16:32.230 --> 00:16:35.130
Oh no! Now I remember my mission!

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:37.920
I must straighten her out!

00:16:37.920 --> 00:16:39.190
It's none of your business.

00:16:39.190 --> 00:16:41.400
No! I can't just let you be!

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:42.860
We're friends!

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:45.190
At this rate, it'll get worse!

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:47.780
You won't become a splendid person like that!

00:16:47.780 --> 00:16:49.910
Yes! Splendid!

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:54.090
A splendid person, very much so like me!

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:55.220
Huh?

00:16:55.220 --> 00:16:58.650
Besides, what if you hurt someone else who happens to be around?

00:16:58.650 --> 00:17:02.430
You know how you choke anyone who approaches you from behind.

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:04.410
That won't happen.

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:05.370
Really?

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:07.310
Not even by reflex?

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:09.310
Yeah.

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:10.850
Let's see.

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:14.150
See?

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:15.150
It's fin—

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:18.640
You can do it!

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:21.310
You don't have to strike! You can do it!

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:32.440
See what I mean? You get upset too easily.

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:34.010
Because of you.

00:17:34.010 --> 00:17:37.640
If you didn't lose it so easily, it'd be a lot better.

00:17:37.640 --> 00:17:41.260
You should only lose knives! Just kidding.

00:17:42.420 --> 00:17:45.770
It can't hurt to have composure as an assassin.

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:47.760
What do you want me to do?

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:50.970
It's not good if you get upset easily.

00:17:50.970 --> 00:17:53.600
So, with that said,

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:55.320
we're gonna practice.

00:17:55.320 --> 00:17:59.070
You can't get upset about anything I do from here on.

00:17:59.070 --> 00:18:01.800
Isn't that just a penalty game?

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:11.290
I told you not to do anything!

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:12.620
No you didn't.

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:15.040
I only defended myself with composure.

00:18:17.460 --> 00:18:20.040
<i>Did I mess it up somehow?</i>

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:23.980
You need to learn to be kind!

00:18:23.980 --> 00:18:25.970
What? You're one to talk.

00:18:28.340 --> 00:18:29.850
What are you doing?

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.920
They say when you're around animals, you get kinder.

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.840
Just pretend that I'm a dog.

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:35.850
I hate dogs.

00:18:36.610 --> 00:18:41.320
I'm not scary. Just pretend I'm a dog and pet me.

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:43.300
That's a bit much.

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:45.890
You can ask me to shake, or to let out my paw.

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:47.530
Anything you want.

00:18:48.510 --> 00:18:50.310
How about...

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:51.240
Stay.

00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:11.230
Lunchtime.

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:20.140
If you don't listen, I'll hit you.

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:23.470
I want to be human again...

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:25.110
Dream on.

00:19:25.110 --> 00:19:27.610
This isn't nice at all!

00:19:27.610 --> 00:19:28.860
Let's bring in our new recruit!

00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:30.390
I'm a bunny!

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:32.040
I'm Pyonsuke 03~

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:35.620
I'm actually 02 but since you killed me, I'm 03.

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:36.780
Huh?

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:40.080
Now you can use this stuffed animal to—

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:42.620
How am I supposed to play with this stuffed animal?

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:46.410
When you hold it, you'll be filled with happy feelings.

00:19:50.780 --> 00:19:53.550
<i>That was too much hug...</i>

00:19:55.270 --> 00:19:58.240
Killing 02 and now 03...

00:19:58.240 --> 00:20:00.170
I feel kinder now.

00:20:00.170 --> 00:20:01.760
You didn't need to use that much force!

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.850
You made it explode!

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:05.590
Hey! Where are you going?

00:20:05.590 --> 00:20:06.440
To the bathroom.

00:20:06.440 --> 00:20:07.840
Liar!

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:11.650
You're going to find that guy, aren't you?!

00:20:11.650 --> 00:20:14.180
If you want to get to him, you'll have to pass me first!

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:16.910
If you can... be gentle.

00:20:16.910 --> 00:20:20.980
I just wanted to use the bathroom, but if you insist...

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:23.530
You really aren't gentle!

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:36.850
Ah. I fell asleep.

00:20:40.810 --> 00:20:44.000
You're still far from being a normal human...

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:46.150
I'm worried about your future.

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:48.480
<i>You</i> are worrying about <i>me</i>?

00:20:48.480 --> 00:20:49.830
Oh, I know!

00:20:49.830 --> 00:20:52.250
Why don't you quit being an assassin and be a chiropractor instead?

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:53.330
That was random.

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:55.760
I couldn't think of anything else.

00:20:55.760 --> 00:20:58.970
There are plenty of other things I could do.

00:20:58.970 --> 00:21:02.120
What do you want to do?

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:03.480
I want to be rich.

00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:05.250
That's not an occupation.

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:10.190
Hmmm... Sonya-chan as a chiropractor...

00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:14.370
Is she having another stupid daydream?

00:21:20.770 --> 00:21:22.760
What's wrong today?

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:25.190
I have a crick in my neck...

00:21:25.730 --> 00:21:27.410
Let me see.

00:21:36.210 --> 00:21:39.280
Did I mess up?

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:43.400
Maybe that's no good?

00:22:05.060 --> 00:22:09.240
Chocolate, Sleepiness, Poultices.
